      "content": "\"a valid surrender\"... i don't know. it just feels like there's no other way to actually get some peace. like, if i'm already a ghost to them, then why keep struggling to breathe? it's just so heavy. everything is so heavy and i'm just so tired of being a glitch in someone else's system.",
